# Concept DOI (always resolves to the latest archived version) goes here after the
# first Zenodo deposit, as:  doi: 10.5281/zenodo.XXXXXXXX
# A placeholder would fail the CFF 1.2.0 DOI pattern and stop GitHub rendering
# "Cite this repository"; omitting an optional key does not.
